e immutable Java records; component accessors, canonical constructors, equals/hashCode/toString are generated and omitted.&#xa;Input: serviceId ≥ 1; content 10–3000 characters. Explanation/Decision: revision ≥ 0; content 10–3000 characters.&#xa;Decision.action is a String restricted to REQUEST_EXPLANATION | DISMISS | REMOVE, not a Java enum.&#xa;DTO associations represent references, not JPA relationships; string image URLs are not entity associations." style="text;html=0;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fontFamily=Arial;fontSize=13;fontStyle=0;spacing=0;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="40" y="1300" width="1820" height="150" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="21" style="edgeStyle=none;rounded=0;html=0;exitX=0;exitY=0.6;entryX=1;entryY=0.5;endArrow=open;endFill=0;strokeColor=#475569;" edge="1" parent="1" source="15" target="12"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="22" value="" style="edgeLabel;html=0;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;fontSize=14;" vertex="1" connectable="0" parent="21"><mxGeometry x="-1" relative="1" as="geometry"><mxPoint x="-50" y="-18" as="offset"/></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="23" value="1" style="edgeLabel;html=0;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;fontSize=14;" vertex="1" connectable="0" parent="21"><mxGeometry x="1" relative="1" as="geometry"><mxPoint x="10" y="-18" as="offset"/></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="24" style="edgeStyle=none;rounded=0;html=0;exitX=1;exitY=0.6;entryX=0;entryY=0.5;endArrow=open;endFill=0;strokeColor=#475569;" edge="1" parent="1" source="15" target="18"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="25" value="" style="edgeLabel;html=0;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;fontSize=14;" vertex="1" connectable="0" parent="24"><mxGeometry x="-1" relative="1" as="geometry"><mxPoint x="8" y="-18" as="offset"/></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="26" value="0..*" style="edgeLabel;html=0;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;fontSize=14;" vertex="1" connectabl